    "summary": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-26 contains a use-after-free vulnerability in the FormatMagickCaption...",
    "details": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-26 contains a use-after-free vulnerability in the FormatMagickCaption method when memory allocation fails. Attackers can trigger memory allocation failures to cause a dangling pointer to reference freed memory, potentially enabling denial of service or code execution.",
